            ]
          },
          {
            "url": "https://www.forbes.com/sites/charleswallace1/2018/07/31/trade-war-hurts-china-while-u-s-economy-booms/",
            "title": "Trade War Hurts China While U.S. Economy Booms",
            "snippets": [
